    "scenario": "RIP Summarization",
    "goals": "• Configure RIP version 2 on all routers and make sure you have full connectivity.\n• Create a summary on router {{router2_name}} so all networks on the loopback interfaces are advertised as one optimal route.\n• Create four summaries for the loopback interfaces on router {{router3_name}} without having overlapping networks.\n• Create one summary on router {{router4_name}} so all networks on the loopback interfaces are advertised as one optimal route.",
